Z||000002||frontal lobe||03-13-2001||11:34 PM||||Way to go, Hank.  Going to basketball tournament games while in college is so great.  I went to Iowa and while I was there we made it to the Final Four.  It was in Indianapolis that year--only a 5 hour drive for me.  I'll always remember what a fun time it was.  Walking around between games once my brother and I ran into skinny, VERY tall guys legs, looked (way) up, and saw it was Ralph Sampson.  He was a freshman at Virginia that year.  They didn't make the Final Four that year, so he must have just paid his way to watch.<P>Have a great time.  Go Penn State.  I root for all Big Ten teams in the tournament, especially Iowa of course.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Hank is Here||03-14-2001||12:02 AM||||I made it the the semi final NIT game last year for PSU at Madison Square Garden.  Luckely I was living in Jersey and it was just an hour train ride right to the arena.  <BR> <BR>I am pumped, I'll be happy to go past the first round.  I am not jking myself about the second round though.<BR> ||||reg||1
